				"english"		"[b]Game Audio Director:[/b] Yasuyuki Tsujino (Capcom)\r\n[b]Original Game Audio Director:[/b] Ippo Yamada (Inti Creates)\r\n[b]Composer:[/b] Ippo Yamada (Inti Creates), Ryo Kawakami (Inti Creates), Masaki Suzuki, Koji Hayama, Luna Umegaki (Crysta)\r\n[b]Mastering Engineer:[/b] Takahisa Yuzawa (JVC Kenwood Creative Media)\r\n[b]Mastering Studio:[/b] JVC Kenwood Creative Media Akasaka Studio\r\n[b]Jacket Illustrator:[/b] Makoto Yabe\r\n[b]Package Art Direction & Designer:[/b] Masae Sato (High Kick Entertainment)\r\n[b]Product Management:[/b] Masahide Akitake (Capcom)\r\n[b]Product Coordinater:[/b] Shimpei Takasugi (Capcom), Hiroaki Kitaura (Capcom)\r\n[b]Special Thanks:[/b] Ippo Yamada (Inti Creates), Takuya Aizu (Inti Creates), Kazuhiro Tsuchiya (Capcom), Tsukasa Takenaka (Capcom), Ucchi (Capcom), [i]Mega Man Zero[/i] and [i]Mega Man ZX[/i] Series Development Staff"
